  ind-ID, jav-ID, kat-GE, kaz-KZ, khm-KH, kik-KE, kin-RW, kir-KG, lao-LA, lin-CD, ltz-LU, lug-UG, mai-IN,
  mkd-MK, mlg-MG, mon-MN, mri-NZ, msa-MY, mya-MM, nep-NP, orm-ET, pcm-NG, pnb-PK, run-BI, sin-LK, sna-ZW,
