- Updated: The eng-US and ger-DE translations are complete.


Changes from version 6.0.17 to 6.0.18 (2026-10-26)
====================================

*Bugs*

- Fix: ezstarrating_data.session_key stores a SHA-256 hash of the session id instead of the session id,
  and is 64 characters wide; update/database/<database>/6.0.18/dbupdate-6.0.17-to-6.0.18.sql
  migrates existing installations; run it first and deploy the code right after it
  (see README, "Upgrading"); from ekked's pull request #11. The update script can be run twice.
- Fix: A rating the server refuses shows the server's error text (ezjscore's error_text) instead of
  "undefined".

*Enhancements*

- The star rating runs without jQuery, from ekked's pull request #8.
- Swahili (Kenya) translation, from ekked's pull request #9.
- Translations into eighteen more administration languages: Hindi, Korean, Bosnian, Lower Sorbian,
  Estonian, Irish, Icelandic, Greenlandic, Latvian, Hungarian, Maltese, Romanian, Albanian, Slovak,
  Slovenian, Japanese, Greek and Finnish, from ekked's pull request #10.
- Russian, Catalan, Serbian (Cyrillic and Latin), Bulgarian, Lithuanian, Portuguese (Portugal) and
  Afrikaans translations, from ekked's pull request #12.
- Translations into seventeen languages from South Asia and Africa: Bengali, Urdu, Marathi, Telugu,
  Tamil, Gujarati, Kannada, Malayalam, Punjabi, Odia, Hausa, Amharic, Yoruba, Igbo, isiZulu, Somali and
  isiXhosa, from ekked's pull request #13.
- Chinese translations in Simplified (chi-CN) and Traditional (chi-TW) script; chi-HK falls back to
  chi-TW, from ekked's pull request #14.


